# Chapter V opens: two of the Kanzler's guards take the player to the old
# magician Calisto, whom the Kanzler wants dead. Calisto is an old friend; one
# guard kills the other, and Calisto leaves his house.
# Position stands in for the walks the guards take no part in; where they
# follow, the player walks. Ref FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from theater_guards
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# The two guards in front of the theater greet the player and come along. The
# second enables himself only while the journal is still 2, which the first's
# greeting moves on, so the player arrives ~1200 units out, as a walker would,
# and the guards' scripts run before the approach. The spot is on the navmesh (a walk needs a start triangle).
case theater_guards
# The thieves' guild fight follows the player out (DiebBoernAufbrausende, DiebGardeshSilberzunge): a player in
# combat runs no travel package, so the walk below never starts.
defend
run
player->Position -776 48005 239 0
wait 120
# Walked in, not placed: Wache02 greets within 500 and Wache01 within 400, so an approaching player meets Wache02
# first ("we will accompany you", journal 2 -> 3 and both follow). The walk stops on its own route inside
# Wache02's range only (388 from him, 451 from Wache01): ending inside both is a race between the two scripts.
# A walk may stop up to 128 short; along this route that still leaves the player within ~485 of Wache02.
walk -690 48955 208
until 300 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_V_TheaterTreffen == 3
# The second guard then greets on his own (TheaterWache02: Stormwendvar 20, within 500).
until 300 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
end

# Calisto's house near Castle Grel, the guards following the player; they
# stay outside.
case theater_calisto_house
# The guards follow, so the player walks there; the gate guard's recruiting pitch and STADAntonia
# outside the gate may greet on the way, which ends a walk, so the walk is taken up again.
defend
# The engine's route walks into the gap between a rock and a tree south of the town and stalls on
# the X0Y6 hill: the player steers past both (the old route's turns), at pace 10 for the climb.
walk -1641 28801 742
bye if open
walk -1641 28801 742
bye if open
pace 10
steer -1145 27342 418
walk 1994 26389 201
bye if open
walk 1994 26389 201
steer 2270 26119 354
steer 2251 25961 524
steer 2161 25751 552
steer 2018 25584 580
steer 1987 25499 596
steer 1729 24498 1015
pace 25
# A long walk round the PastureLand mountains (several cells): legs at the north valley's turns, since the
# engine otherwise takes the newly meshed slopes over the hill east and slides back on them.
walk 9960 28811 450
bye if open
walk 11602 31869 450
bye if open
walk 14089 34673 450
bye if open
walk 33300 37150 123
bye if open
walk 33300 37150 123
bye if open
walk 33300 37150 123
bye if open
walk 33300 37150 123
until 3000 "TheaterTreffenWache01"->GetDistance player < 800
until 3000 "TheaterTreffenWache02"->GetDistance player < 800
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_V_TheaterTreffen == 4
# "We'll stand watch out here": both guards stop following before the door.
until 600 "TheaterTreffenWache01"->GetCurrentAIPackage != 3
until 600 "TheaterTreffenWache02"->GetCurrentAIPackage != 3
activate 055BCF10
until 300 GetPCCell "Calisto's House" == 1
end

# Inside.
case theater_inside
run
player->PositionCell -216 740 127 0 "Calisto's House"
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_V_TheaterTreffen == 5
end

# Calisto remembers that night, and proposes a pact against the Kanzler.
case theater_calisto
run
player->PositionCell -257 200 136 0 "Calisto's House"
talk CalistoHausCalisto01
ask remember that night
choose 1
choose 2
choose 3
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_V_TheaterTreffen == 6
until 300 "TheaterTreffenWache01"->GetHealth <= 0
end

# Outside, the surviving guard explains, and leaves to report to the Kanzler.
case theater_guard_report
activate 052ED5FB
until 300 GetPCCell "Calisto's House" == 0
talk TheaterTreffenWache02
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_V_TheaterTreffen == 7
end
